---
description: Multi-theme enforcement
globs: "**/*"
alwaysApply: true
---

## Themes Seelctable buy users
Supported:
- Light
- Dark
- Blue (Corporate)
- Pink

## Rules
- NO hex colors
- NO text-blue-500 etc.
- ONLY semantic classes: text-primary, bg-card, border-accent

## Source of Truth
- app/ui/theme/themes.ts → vars()
- tailwind.config.js → var(--color-*)

## Charts
- Chart colors must come from theme context
